From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PANP2010 <18610364979@163.com>
Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 11:25:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Nebula Tick Driver - replace EDF scheduler with single
 coordinator thread

Introduces NebulaTickDriver that replaces Folia's EDF/WorkStealing thread pool
with a single coordinator thread running on a 50ms tick cycle. The coordinator
sequentially ticks all active regions, preserving existing per-region tick
logic while centralizing scheduling control.

Key changes:
- Add NEBULA scheduler type to TickRegionScheduler
- TickThreadRunner visibility widened for coordinator thread inheritance
- NebulaTickDriver coordinates global tick + sequential region ticks
- TickRegions/RegionizedServer conditionally bypass EDF scheduling in NEBULA mode

